  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WETLAND-ASSOCIATED MIGRATORY BIRD HABITA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project represents NCCs multi-year commitment and contribution to the work of the Prairie Habitat Joint Venture (PHJV) and the North American Waterfowl Management Plan (NAWMP). This project will acquire 565 acres (141 wetland and 424 upland) of new wetland and associated upland habitat and to manage this exceptional habitat in perpetuity as prescribed by the PHJV 2013-2020 Prairie Parklands Implementation Plan.</narrative>
  </description>
